Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 10:29:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] Add index on audit_log extension columns, found by the
 performance test

Replacing an extension (INSERT OR REPLACE) made SQLite scan the whole audit
log to check the foreign key, about 43 ms per student with 608,000 entries,
so a class extension for 800 students took 36 s. The index is in schema.sql
and is also created when an older database is opened. Version 1.1.1.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011ivwY7ryLHZpp8Pc5k6y9K
